  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, would you take a look at this Corvisquire?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C00200077006F0075006C006400200079006F0075002000740061006B0065002000610020006C006F006F006B0020006100740020007400680069007300200043006F007200760069007300710075006900720065003F00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You see that raggedy silk scarf it’s carrying?\nSeems like it’s dear to Corvisquire...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My best guess is that Corvisquire came here\nlooking for the owner of that scarf.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But the only clue I’ve got to go on is this name\nembroidered on the scarf: <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Destin<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah-CAW!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002D0043004100570021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See? It reacted just now when I said the name\n“Destin”! That’s gotta mean something.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf I could only find out more about this scarf...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you know anybody who would be\nknowledgeable about clothes and things?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I could ask Naveen",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200063006F0075006C0064002000610073006B0020004E0061007600650065006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I could ask Lida",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200063006F0075006C0064002000610073006B0020004C0069006400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, what’s up?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nA...scarf?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSorry, I don’t think I’ll be much help. Naveen’s\nprobably better to ask about that kind of thing!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hello?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou have a question about a scarf?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065006C006C006F003F00100001BE01000A0059006F007500200068006100760065002000610020007100750065007300740069006F006E002000610062006F0075007400200061002000730063006100720066003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I am fairly familiar with different materials and\nsewing methods, of course, but even I can’t just<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlook at a scarf and tell you who it belongs to.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know! Perhaps you could try asking Asami?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006B006E006F007700210020005000650072006800610070007300200079006F007500200063006F0075006C00640020007400720079002000610073006B0069006E00670020004100730061006D0069003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "While she can be rather a handful to deal with,\nAsami at Boutique Couture is a pro designer.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nShe’ll likely recognize something about this scarf.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Don’t give up, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. I’m sure\nyou’ll<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfind<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nowner.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000044006F006E2019007400200067006900760065002000750070002C00200010000201000000002E002000492019006D00200073007500720065000A0079006F00752019006C006C00100001BE00000A00660069006E006400100001BE00000A00740068006500100001BE00000A006F0077006E00650072002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve got the look of someone who has found a\nlead to pursue.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPlease—help find the owner of this scarf for\nCorvisquire!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please help find the owner of that scarf for\nCorvisquire!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002000680065006C0070002000660069006E006400200074006800650020006F0077006E006500720020006F00660020007400680061007400200073006300610072006600200066006F0072000A0043006F007200760069007300710075006900720065002100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The fashion designer Asami is at your service. Did\nyou need something?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll bet you’re here for another stylish\nMega Evolution battle, aren’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, no—please look at this scarf",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006E006F20140070006C00650061007300650020006C006F006F006B002000610074002000740068006900730020007300630061007200660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please just look at this scarf",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C00650061007300650020006A0075007300740020006C006F006F006B002000610074002000740068006900730020007300630061007200660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just look at the scarf, lady!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0075007300740020006C006F006F006B0020006100740020007400680065002000730063006100720066002C0020006C00610064007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, you want my evaluation of this scarf because\nyou have such faith in my skills as a designer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, this scarf is...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C00200074006800690073002000730063006100720066002000690073002E002E002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s quite filthy.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut I do recognize the material and design. These\nscarves are given out to new students at a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncertain school in the city of Wyndon in Galar.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI believe this is the design from three years ago.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 223
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But why do you have this?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002000770068007900200064006F00200079006F00750020006800610076006500200074006800690073003F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This Corvisquire brought it here",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200043006F007200760069007300710075006900720065002000620072006F0075006700680074002000690074002000680065007200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re trying to locate its owner",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006520190072006500200074007200790069006E006700200074006F0020006C006F006300610074006500200069007400730020006F0077006E006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Searching out the lost owner of a scarf with only\nan embroidered name to go on...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhat a stylish adventure! I love it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Have you inquired yet at Académie Étoile?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf the owner is now living in Lumiose, it’s possible\nthey came to study at that academy.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If that scarf’s owner is now living in Lumiose,\nthey may be studying at Académie Étoile.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah-CAW!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002D0043004100570021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What the heck?! What’s with this Corvisquire?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200074006800650020006800650063006B003F00210020005700680061007420190073002000770069007400680020007400680069007300200043006F007200760069007300710075006900720065003F002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait... Are you...ROOKIDEE?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100690074002E002E002E002000410072006500200079006F0075002E002E002E0052004F004F004B0049004400450045003F002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No way! But—but we met in the Galar region! You\ncame all the way across the sea to find me?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But you were hurt back then...and you were so\nsmall...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200079006F007500200077006500720065002000680075007200740020006200610063006B0020007400680065006E002E002E002E0061006E006400200079006F00750020007700650072006500200073006F000A0073006D0061006C006C002E002E002E00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But you still came to find me here in Lumiose\nafter I moved?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200079006F00750020007300740069006C006C002000630061006D006500200074006F002000660069006E00640020006D00650020006800650072006500200069006E0020004C0075006D0069006F00730065000A00610066007400650072002000490020006D006F007600650064003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re the BEST, Corvisquire!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075201900720065002000740068006500200042004500530054002C00200043006F007200760069007300710075006900720065002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cahhh!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006100680068006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, Trainer! You helped Corvisquire find its way\nhere to me, right? Thanks a million!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you think Corvisquire would like to be my\npartner and battle with me and all?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why wouldn’t it?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068007900200077006F0075006C0064006E20190074002000690074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I bet it’d love that",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006200650074002000690074201900640020006C006F00760065002000740068006100740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, d’you think I could ask you one more favor,\nwhile you’re here and all?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI want a battle together with Corvisquire!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just tell me as soon as you’re ready! I can’t wait!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A007500730074002000740065006C006C0020006D006500200061007300200073006F006F006E00200061007300200079006F0075201900720065002000720065006100640079002100200049002000630061006E2019007400200077006100690074002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Will you battle Corvisquire and me?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
